# Filter Hz 1.3.0: scene locks on the FX track's REVERB page: FRQ, HPF and LPF in hertz, LPF
# from the scene's HPF. FRQ 63, HPF 38, LPF 40, each nudged twice in scene 1's edit.
# Clears scene 1 (edit list: <CLEAR>, YES) before and after, so it leaves scene 1 empty. SCNE is
# tapped three times: mode on, edit off, mode off (edit itself opens with FUNC + BD).
name: filter-hz-reverb-scene
state: changes
# FX is a toggle (pressed on the FX track it goes back to the drum track), so BD is selected first.
hold TRK
key BD
release TRK
key FX
key SRC
key SMPL
wait 3500
cc 26 63
cc 28 38
cc 29 40
key SCNE
wait 300
hold FUNC
key BD
release FUNC
wait 500
key LEFT x3
key RIGHT x2
wait 300
key YES
wait 500
screen cleared
hold BD
nudge C +1
nudge C +1
nudge E +1
nudge E +1
nudge F +1
nudge F +1
wait 750
screen scene
expect scene == ref region 0 9 128 55
release BD
wait 300
key LEFT x3
key RIGHT x2
wait 300
key YES
wait 500
key SCNE
wait 300
key SCNE
